  "description": "SEG BLM MOTOR\n\nThe iGravelX is equipped with the SEG BLM motor, an ultra-light 2.1 kg drive unit delivering up to 700 W of power and 80 Nm of torque for powerful, smooth and highly efficient assistance.\n\n810Wh | DUAL DISCHARGE TECHNOLOGY\n\nEvery model features a fully integrated 630 Wh battery housed inside the downtube, optimizing weight distribution for a more stable and natural ride.\n\nThe system is complemented by the XPro bottle-style battery.\n\nTotal Capacity:\n\n630 Wh + 180 Wh (XPro Dual Discharge) = 810 Wh\n\nEstimated Range:\n\n150 km + 40 km (XPro Dual Discharge) = 190 km\n\nSEG BLM DISPLAY\n\nA fully integrated top tube display provides all essential ride information at a glance, including speed, assistance mode, battery range, power output, cadence, rider torque and ANT+ connectivity.\n\niBUTTONS\n\nThe iButtons allow instant assistance mode changes directly from the handlebar. Because they are wired directly to the battery, they provide immediate response with zero delay. A clean, reliable system that keeps your focus on the ride.\n\nCOMFORTABLE, LIGHTWEIGHT AND HIGHLY RESPONSIV\n\nLike every premium BH frame, the iGravelX is manufactured using HCIM (Hollow Core Internal Molding) carbon technology, allowing us to minimize frame weight.\n\nHigh Modulus carbon fibres combined with our Ballistic Carbon Layup deliver the ideal balance of lightweight performance and outstanding impact resistance for demanding off-road conditions.\n\nFULL CARBON GRAVEL FORK\n\nThe iGravelX features a full carbon gravel fork designed to maximize tyre clearance, accommodating tyres up to 50 mm wide for greater capability, comfort and control on rough terrain.\n\nFULLY INTERNAL CABLE ROUTING\n\nA clean frame with 100% internal cable routing through the ACR system.",
